<title>USA: Ackerley reports higher Q1 revenues.</title>
<headline>Ackerley reports higher Q1 revenues.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ackerley Group Inc said Tuesday its first quarter revenues totalled $79.3 million, up 14 percent from $69.8 million a year earlier.</p>
<p>The Ackerley Group is a media and entertainment operation comprised of three operating segments -- the Out-of-Home segment, the broadcasting segment, and the sports and entertainment segment.</p>
<p>All segments reported increased gross revenue of at least 10 percent, with the Out-of-Home segment providing the greatest percentage increase, Ackerley said.</p>
</text>
